  "content": "<div style=\"text-align:center;font-family:Arial\">\n  <div style=\"color:#fff;background-image:linear-gradient(160deg, #140122, #207489)\">\n    <br>\n    <h1 style=\"font-size:5ic;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;display:inline-block\">Black Mesa Skyboxes</h1>\n  </div>\n  <h2 style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:32px\">將黑山基地的天空盒引入 Minecraft</h2>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fewanhowell.com%252fresourcepacks%252fblack-mesa-skyboxes\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size:20px;line-height:40px;color:#1ea1f1;display:block\" rel=\"nofollow\">在我的網站上查看資源包！</a>\n  <br><br><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/E6_Cxt1mocY\" width=\"600\" height=\"336\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><br>\n  <br>\n  <p>此資源包將遊戲《Black Mesa》中的天空盒紋理添加到 Minecraft 中。在主世界體驗黑山基地各處的天空盒，以及在終界维度體驗 Xen 的天空盒！</p>\n  <br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/948/570/end1.png\" width=\"600\" alt=\"The End\"><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/948/571/day.png\" width=\"600\" alt=\"Day\"><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/948/572/evening.png\" width=\"600\" alt=\"Evening\"><br>\n  <br>\n  <div>⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯</div>\n  <br>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.ewanhowell.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://ewanhowell.com/assets/images/icons/discord.png\" width=\"48\">\n    <div style=\"line-height:6px\"></div>\n    <p style=\"font-size:20px;text-decoration:underline;color:#5662f6\">加入 Discord 伺服器！</p>\n  </a>\n  <div style=\"line-height:12px\"></div>\n  <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@EwanHowell\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://ewanhowell.com/assets/images/icons/youtube.png\" width=\"48\">\n    <div style=\"line-height:6px\"></div>\n    <p style=\"font-size:20px;text-decoration:underline;color:#fff\">在 YouTube 上訂閱！</p>\n  </a>\n  <div style=\"line-height:12px\"></div>\n  <a href=\"https://twitter.com/ewanhowell5195\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://ewanhowell.com/assets/images/icons/twitter.png\" width=\"48\">\n    <div style=\"line-height:6px\"></div>\n    <p style=\"font-size:20px;text-decoration:underline;color:#1ea1f1\">在 Twitter 上關注我！</p>\n  </a>\n  <div style=\"line-height:12px\"></div>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fewanhowell\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://ewanhowell.com/assets/images/icons/ko-fi.png\" width=\"48\">\n    <div style=\"line-height:6px\"></div>\n    <p style=\"font-size:20px;text-decoration:underline;color:#17ccff\">在 Ko-fi 上支持我！</p>\n  </a>\n</div>",
